'>{}</span>", "ja490:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja490:10.1": "<p data-counter='31'><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja490:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja490:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja490:13.1": "<p data-counter='41'><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja490:14.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:14.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:14.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:14.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja490:15.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:15.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:15.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:15.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja490:16.1": "<p data-counter='51'><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:16.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:16.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja490:16.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja490:17.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja490:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja490:0.2": "Pakiṇṇakanipāta ", "ja490:0.3": "Sālikedāravagga ", "ja490:0.4": "7. Pañcuposathikajātaka ", "ja490:1.1": "“Appossukko dāni tuvaṁ kapota, ", "ja490:1.2": "Vihaṅgama na tava bhojanattho; ", "ja490:1.3": "Khudaṁ pipāsaṁ adhivāsayanto, ", "ja490:1.4": "Kasmā bhavaṁposathiko kapota”. ", "ja490:2.1": "“Ahaṁ pure giddhigato kapotiyā, ", "ja490:2.2": "Asmiṁ padesasmimubho ramāma; ", "ja490:2.3": "Athaggahī sākuṇiko kapotiṁ, ", "ja490:2.4": "Akāmako tāya vinā ahosiṁ. ", "ja490:3.1": "Nānābhavā vippayogena tassā, ", "ja490:3.2": "Manomayaṁ vedana vedayāmi; ", "ja490:3.3": "Tasmā ahaṁposathaṁ pālayāmi, ", "ja490:3.4": "Rāgo mamaṁ mā punarāgamāsi”. ", "ja490:4.1": "“Anujjugāmī uragā dujivha, ", "ja490:4.2": "Dāṭhāvudho ghoravisosi sappa; ", "ja490:4.3": "Khudaṁ pipāsaṁ adhivāsayanto, ", "ja490:4.4": "Kasmā bhavaṁposathiko nu dīgha. ", "ja490:5.1": "Usabho ahū balavā gāmikassa, ", "ja490:5.2": "Calakkakū vaṇṇabalūpapanno; ", "ja490:5.3": "So maṁ akkami taṁ kupito aḍaṁsiṁ, ", "ja490:5.4": "Dukkhābhitunno maraṇaṁ upāgā. ", "ja490:6.1": "Tato janā nikkhamitvāna gāmā, ", "ja490:6.2": "Kanditvā roditvā apakkamiṁsu; ", "ja490:6.3": "Tasmā ahaṁposathaṁ pālayāmi, ", "ja490:6.4": "Kodho mamaṁ mā punarāgamāsi. ", "ja490:7.1": "Matāna maṁsāni bahū susāne, ", "ja490:7.2": "Manuññarūpaṁ tava bhojane taṁ; ", "ja490:7.3": "Khudaṁ pipāsaṁ adhivāsayanto, ", "ja490:7.4": "Kasmā bhavaṁposathiko siṅgāla. ", "ja490:8.1": "Pavisi kucchiṁ mahato gajassa, ", "ja490:8.2": "Kuṇape rato hatthimaṁsesu giddho; ", "ja490:8.3": "Uṇho ca vāto tikhiṇā ca rasmiyo, ", "ja490:8.4": "Te sosayuṁ tassa karīsamaggaṁ. ", "ja490:9.1": "Kiso ca paṇḍū ca ahaṁ bhadante, ", "ja490:9.2": "Na me ahū nikkhamanāya maggo; ", "ja490:9.3": "Mahā ca megho sahasā pavassi, ", "ja490:9.4": "So temayī tassa karīsamaggaṁ. ", "ja490:10.1": "Tato ahaṁ nikkhamisaṁ bhadante, ", "ja490:10.2": "Cando yathā rāhumukhā pamutto; ", "ja490:10.3": "Tasmā ahaṁposathaṁ pālayāmi, ", "ja490:10.4": "Lobho mamaṁ mā punarāgamāsi. ", "ja490:11.1": "Vammīkathūpasmiṁ kipillikāni, ", "ja490:11.2": "Nippothayanto tuvaṁ pure carāsi; ", "ja490:11.3": "Khudaṁ pipāsaṁ adhivāsayanto, ", "ja490:11.4": "Kasmā bhavaṁposathiko nu accha. ", "ja490:12.1": "Sakaṁ niketaṁ atihīḷayāno, ", "ja490:12.2": "Atricchatā mallagāmaṁ agacchiṁ; ", "ja490:12.3": "Tato janā nikkhamitvāna gāmā, ", "ja490:12.4": "Kodaṇḍakena paripothayiṁsu maṁ. ", "ja490:13.1": "So bhinnasīso ruhiramakkhitaṅgo, ", "ja490:13.2": "Paccāgamāsiṁ sakaṁ niketaṁ; ", "ja490:13.3": "Tasmā ahaṁposathaṁ pālayāmi, ", "ja490:13.4": "Atricchatā mā punarāgamāsi”. ", "ja490:14.1": "“Yaṁ no apucchittha tuvaṁ bhadante, ", "ja490:14.2": "Sabbeva byākarimha yathāpajānaṁ; ", "ja490:14.3": "Mayampi pucchāma tuvaṁ bhadante, ", "ja490:14.4": "Kasmā bhavaṁposathiko nu brahme”. ", "ja490:15.1": "“Anūpalitto mama assamamhi, ", "ja490:15.2": "Paccekabuddho muhuttaṁ nisīdi; ", "ja490:15.3": "So maṁ avedī gatimāgatiñca, ", "ja490:15.4": "Nāmañca gottaṁ caraṇañca sabbaṁ. ", "ja490:16.1": "Evampahaṁ vandi na tassa pāde, ", "ja490:16.2": "Na cāpi naṁ mānagatena pucchiṁ; ", "ja490:16.3": "Tasmā ahaṁposathaṁ pālayāmi, ", "ja490:16.4": "Māno mamaṁ mā punarāgamāsī”ti. ", "ja490:17.1": "Pañcuposathikajātakaṁ sattamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja490:0.1": "", "ja490:0.2": "", "ja490:0.3": "", "ja490:0.4": "", "ja490:1.1": "kapota → kapoto (bj); kapoṭo (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja490:1.2": "", "ja490:1.3": "Khudaṁ → khuddaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr); khudhaṁ (sakkata-pākatānurūpaṁ) ", "ja490:1.4": "", "ja490:2.1": "", "ja490:2.2": "", "ja490:2.3": "", "ja490:2.4": "", "ja490:3.1": "", "ja490:3.2": "vedana vedayāmi → vedanaṁ vediyāmi (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja490:3.3": "", "ja490:3.4": "", "ja490:4.1": "uragā dujivha → uraga dvijivha (bj); uraga dujivha (sya1ed, sya2ed); uragaddujivha (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja490:4.2": "", "ja490:4.3": "", "ja490:4.4": "dīgha → dīgho (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja490:5.1": "", "ja490:5.2": "", "ja490:5.3": "", "ja490:5.4": "upāgā → upāgami (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja490:6.1": "", "ja490:6.2": "Kanditvā roditvā → kanditvā roditva (bj); kanditva roditva (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja490:6.3": "", "ja490:6.4": "", "ja490:7.1": "", "ja490:7.2": "", "ja490:7.3": "", "ja490:7.4": "siṅgāla → sigālo (bj, pts-vp-pli1); sigāla (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja490:8.1": "Pavisi → pavissa (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); pavissaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja490:8.2": "hatthimaṁsesu giddho → hatthimaṁse pagiddho (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja490:8.3": "", "ja490:8.4": "", "ja490:9.1": "", "ja490:9.2": "", "ja490:9.3": "", "ja490:9.4": "", "ja490:10.1": "", "ja490:10.2": "", "ja490:10.3": "", "ja490:10.4": "", "ja490:11.1": "", "ja490:11.2": "", "ja490:11.3": "", "ja490:11.4": "accha → accho (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja490:12.1": "atihīḷayāno → atihīlayāno (bj); atiheḷayāno (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja490:12.2": "Atricchatā → atricchatāya (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) | mallagāmaṁ → malataṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1); mallayataṁ (mr) ", "ja490:12.3": "", "ja490:12.4": "", "ja490:13.1": "", "ja490:13.2": "sakaṁ → sasakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr); 'tha sakaṁ (?) ", "ja490:13.3": "", "ja490:13.4": "", "ja490:14.1": "", "ja490:14.2": "", "ja490:14.3": "", "ja490:14.4": "", "ja490:15.1": "", "ja490:15.2": "", "ja490:15.3": "", "ja490:15.4": "", "ja490:16.1": "Evampahaṁ vandi na → evampahaṁ naggahe (bj, pts-vp-pli1); evampihaṁ vandi na (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja490:16.2": "", "ja490:16.3": "", "ja490:16.4": "", "ja490:17.1": "Pañcuposathikajātakaṁ → pañcuposathajātakaṁ (bj); pañcūposathajātakaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja490:0.1": "", "ja490:0.2": "", "ja490:0.3": "", "ja490:0.4": "", "ja490:1.1": "bj30.504, csp1ed22.291, csp2ed22.291, ms22J_2680, msdiv127, pts-vp-pli4.329, sya27.385", "ja490:1.2": "", "ja490:1.3": "", "ja490:1.4": "", "ja490:2.1": "ms22J_2681, msdiv128", "ja490:2.2": "", "ja490:2.3": "", "ja490:2.4": "", "ja490:3.1": "ms22J_2682, msdiv129", "ja490:3.2": "", "ja490:3.3": "", "ja490:3.4": "", "ja490:4.1": "dr27.385, ms22J_2683, msdiv130, pts-vp-pli4.330", "ja490:4.2": "", "ja490:4.3": "", "ja490:4.4": "", "ja490:5.1": "ms22J_2684, msdiv131, ndp22.286", "ja490:5.2": "", "ja490:5.3": "", "ja490:5.4": "", "ja490:6.1": "ms22J_2685, msdiv132, sya27.38